MEGA65 (model $03), 384K chip RAM, 8MB attic RAM

>10 ENVELOPE 1,2,1,-1,0,4,4,0,126,-4,0,-126,126,100
>20 SOUND 1,1,100,20
>30 FOR I%=1 TO 24:T%=TIME:REPEAT UNTIL TIME>=T%+2:PRINT ?&1F8D;" ";:NEXT:PRINT
>40 ENVELOPE 2,130,10,0,0,3,0,0,126,-4,0,-126,126,100
>50 SOUND 2,2,50,40
>60 FOR I%=1 TO 12:T%=TIME:REPEAT UNTIL TIME>=T%+10:PRINT ?&1F95;" ";:NEXT:PRINT
>70 SOUND 3,-15,60,10:PRINT ?&1F98,?&1F9D
>RUN
